Used: composite regression coefficients (har_19_composite_coef); Hutchinson-Knopoff / Sethares / Vassilakis roughness
formulas (model-dycon.R); Milne/Harrison-Pearce pitch-class harmonicity (model-har18.R, hrep milne-pc-spectrum.R);
Billboard chord-type counts (data/popular_1_pc_chord_type.rda, derived from the McGill Billboard corpus, Burgoyne 2011).
Python code in this repository is an independent reimplementation, not a translation of the C++ sources.
